OL,3,AFrench police fire tear gas at school
OL,4,Aprotesters as officer charged over
OL,5,Astudent hit by projectile
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday police fired tear gas in
OL,8,Fprotests, including in the capital and
OL,9,FMarseille - our reporter there said he
OL,10,Fcould "feel it in my throat and eyes"
OL,12,FIn Lyon, a barricade was set on fire;
OL,13,Fwhile in Rennes, police used water
OL,14,Fcannon. In Paris, one 17-year-old told
OL,15,Fus she studies in "overcrowded" classes
OL,16,Fof 35
OL,18,FBut, as Mark Lowen reported from
OL,19,FMarseille, it's hard to see how the
OL,20,Fdemands will be met by a government
OL,21,Fthat urgently needs to rein in public
OL,22,Fspending
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
